{"id":"52c60ab550f6f214","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-forcing-extension.md","title":"ZFC Forcing Extension","display":"df-zfc-forcing-extension — ZFC Forcing Extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing-extension","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing-extension"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing-extension — ZFC Forcing Extension","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md]]","[[58-df-p-name]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing-extension — ZFC Forcing Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"85bf4cca0e5f1662\" href=\"?note=85bf4cca0e5f1662\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md\">../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"51e31cce24feee5c\" href=\"?note=51e31cce24feee5c\" title=\"58-df-p-name\">58-df-p-name</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,G,\\mathbb{P} \\in V\">\\(M,N,G,\\mathbb{P} \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ForcingExtension}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ForcingExtension}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GenericFilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GenericFilter}_S\\)</span> are the four- and three-place predicates from the displayed dependencies</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PName}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PName}_S\\)</span> is the two-place name predicate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_G(\\sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{val}_G(\\sigma)\\)</span> is the recursively defined class term below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}name\\text{-}evaluation} \\vdash \\mathrm{PName}_S(\\sigma,\\mathbb P)\\to\\operatorname{val}_G(\\sigma)=\\left\\{\\operatorname{val}_G(\\tau):\\exists p\\in G\\;(\\langle\\tau,p\\rangle\\in\\sigma)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}name\\text{-}evaluation} \\vdash \\mathrm{PName}_S(\\sigma,\\mathbb P)\\to\\operatorname{val}_G(\\sigma)=\\left\\{\\operatorname{val}_G(\\tau):\\exists p\\in G\\;(\\langle\\tau,p\\rangle\\in\\sigma)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}extension} \\vdash \\mathrm{ForcingExtension}_S(N,M,G,\\mathbb{P}) \\leftrightarrow \\mathbb P\\in M\\land G\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\land\\mathrm{GenericFilter}_S(G,\\mathbb P,M)\\land N=\\{\\operatorname{val}_G(\\sigma):\\sigma\\in M\\land\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\sigma,\\mathbb P)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}extension} \\vdash \\mathrm{ForcingExtension}_S(N,M,G,\\mathbb{P}) \\leftrightarrow \\mathbb P\\in M\\land G\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\land\\mathrm{GenericFilter}_S(G,\\mathbb P,M)\\land N=\\{\\operatorname{val}_G(\\sigma):\\sigma\\in M\\land\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\sigma,\\mathbb P)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Only <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P\">\\(\\mathbb P\\)</span>-names belonging to the ground model are evaluated in the generic extension.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"85bf4cca0e5f1662","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-p-name","status":"resolved","id":"51e31cce24feee5c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-p-name]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,N,G,\\mathbb{P} \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ForcingExtension}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GenericFilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PName}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}_G(\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}name\\text{-}evaluation} \\vdash \\mathrm{PName}_S(\\sigma,\\mathbb P)\\to\\operatorname{val}_G(\\sigma)=\\left\\{\\operatorname{val}_G(\\tau):\\exists p\\in G\\;(\\langle\\tau,p\\rangle\\in\\sigma)\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}extension} \\vdash \\mathrm{ForcingExtension}_S(N,M,G,\\mathbb{P}) \\leftrightarrow \\mathbb P\\in M\\land G\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\land\\mathrm{GenericFilter}_S(G,\\mathbb P,M)\\land N=\\{\\operatorname{val}_G(\\sigma):\\sigma\\in M\\land\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\sigma,\\mathbb P)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb P","display":false}],"bytes":1312,"backlinks":[{"id":"d7aec2ae249e1a21","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"dcf26d8932e8a0a9","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ForcingExtension}_S$ (forcing-extension predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-forcing-extension]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1960","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-forcing-extension.md|58-df-zfc-forcing-extension]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["85bf4c